  "reasoning": "The defendants organized and used a pseudo‑base‑station to send large numbers of fraudulent SMS messages impersonating banks, with the purpose of obtaining money from victims. This constitutes fraud (specifically fraud using information networks). Additionally, the use of a pseudo‑base‑station to transmit messages without authorization is a violation of the provisions on illegal use of telecommunications facilities. Therefore the appropriate charges are fraud and illegal use of telecom facilities.",
